# The shelf holds what the agents produce, and most of it is versioned. Handoffs
# are the exception: CSTs are transient by design (deleted on ingest, swept after
# 24h), they are chmod 600, and they carry raw conversation context. Tracking a
# file built to delete itself is churn; tracking one built to hold session
# contents is worse.
